    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d291">

                <pb facs="0442" n="354" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg354"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Italy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-10-23"><hi rendition="#italic">October 23, 1892</hi></date>.
                        (Received October 25.)</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>:</p>
                <p>I have the honor to inform your excellency that as I was leaving from Chicago I
                    received yesterday from his excellency the minister of foreign affairs of Italy
                    the following telegram: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">October 22, 1892</hi>.</p>
                        <p rendition="#flush">To the <hi rendition="#small-caps">Italian
                                Minister</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                        <p>Yesterday at La Spezia the American flag was saluted with twenty-one
                            guns.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Brin.</hi></p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Accept, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fava.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
